docs: add transfer brief for porting Flow Writer to a VS Code extension

transfer_to_vscode_plugin.md: what the project is and wants to achieve,
which modules port as-is (llama.ts, controller.ts, tests, probe script),
an Obsidian->VS Code API mapping table, the hard-won lessons (trailing-
space token boundary, base-model requirement, one-request beat, glue
tokens, staleness guards, sequential deepening), and a suggested build
order plus reference environment/timings.

